# The rootfs's direct dependencies. requirements.lock is compiled from this file and holds every
# transitive package with the sha256 of every wheel; the Dockerfile installs it with --require-hashes.
# Recompile from this directory (the header of requirements.lock records the exact command).
#
# Each line is a package no other package in the lock requires, pinned to the version the image ran
# when this file was written, so the first compile reproduced that image exactly.

# The kernel and its entry point (jupydroid_kernel.py), and the numeric stack cells import.
